                                                "sense_id": "90531330-6e74-3165-bbeb-095b47b6f5d2",
                                                "text": "His friend nudged me. \"It's true. JJ only scams black ladies.\" / \"You don't say?\" / \"J-boy scammed a real live Miss Black Universe once. Met her in a disco down in Honduras. Wearing her title. Since then he's been obsessed.\""
